    "DisplayDescription": "I\u2019m not gonna give you the whole backstory of what this person has done to us, but all you need to know is that some scumbag is trying to get a payout for a ship crash and the insurance company wants to see the blackbox recording to make sure everything is \u201cabove board\u201d.\n\nWe\u2019re not gonna let that happen though.\n\nSnatch that blackbox at <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> and bring it to us instead so we can do some \u201ccreative editing\u201d on the recording.\n\nApparently, this area is a bit of a hot zone. Probably why they staged the accident there. You should probably bring some backup so you don\u2019t get ghosted before you can bring the blackbox to us at <EM4>[Destination|Target|Address]</EM4>.\n\n-Bit Zeros",
